lumo-agent (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Agent daemon with multiple operational modes (scheduled, on-demand, continuous, hybrid)
  * System diagnostics (CPU, memory, disk, processes, services, network)
  * Security checks (patches, ports, SSH security, auth failures)
  * Kubernetes and Proxmox monitoring capabilities
  * AI analysis via multiple providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, Ollama, Gemini, OpenRouter)
  * TOON format for 30-60% AI token reduction
  * Auto-remediation with human-in-the-loop approval
  * Prometheus metrics endpoint (:9090/metrics)
  * Health check endpoints (:8080/health, /ready, /live)
  * Security hardening with minimal capabilities (CAP_NET_RAW, CAP_SYS_PTRACE, CAP_DAC_READ_SEARCH)
  * Support for Kubernetes DaemonSet and VM systemd deployments
  * Offline mode with local result caching
  * API reporter with exponential backoff and retry logic

 -- Lumo Team <lumo@example.com>  Mon, 18 Nov 2024 12:00:00 +0000
